   "actor": null,
   "text": "I'll be going.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1720583830": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -700796357,
   "actor": "NurseNina",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Leaving already? Don’t forget—if you end up back here, it’s on you. Now, shoo!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-713287314": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2064996421,
   "actor": "NurseNina",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Oh, I’m just chained to this place 24/7, didn’t you know?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "958001817": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1303747724,
   "actor": "NurseNina",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Well, some people respond to sugar, and some to spice.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1288741576": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1721477154,
   "actor": "NurseNina",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, you know, just saving lives, patching up stubborn patients like you. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1868127483": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2064996421,
   "actor": "NurseNina",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "But yeah, I do a little yoga. Nothing like stretching some parts that never get any attention.... ",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "nurseroot"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1799022807": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1303747724,
   "actor": "NurseNina",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Just depends on what you need to stay in line. Annoy me, and you’ll see the spicy side, got it?",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "nurseroot"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-829999189": {
   "kind": "text",
